          "claim": "Prove the exact supplied-object identities and preserve the declared domain: For an exact rational diagonal Gram matrix diag(1,...,1), zero-width intervals yield LDL pivots all 1 and determinant 1. This is an algebraic certificate fixture, not an elliptic height computation.",
