          "claim": "Bound the complete cost, including the currently unresolved acquisition term: C_heightbound+r\u00b2*C_pair(n,H,[K:Q])+O(r\u00b3*b_prec) rational interval operations; memory O(r\u00b2*b_prec)+M_pointgrowth; data exact points and every interval/error witness. Doubling coordinates may grow O(4^n*H) bits.",
          "responsibility": "runtime"
        },
